<title>SRI LANKA: Regnis 12-month net 6.3 pct up.</title>
<headline>Regnis 12-month net 6.3 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited results of Regnis Lanka Ltd, for the 12 months ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				1995	    1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	     255.69   vs   265.13</p>
<p>    Net profit	    12.24   vs    11.52</p>
<p>    Tax			8.05   vs     4.62</p>
<p>NOTE - The company which manufactures refrigerators, chest freezers and bottle coolers, is an associate of Singer (Sri Lanka) Ltd and a unit of Singer Co..</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
